                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does Valentine's drive for jewelry D2C?</h3>
                                        <p>15-25% of Q1 revenue. Engagement + occasion jewelry peaks. Highest-ROI category for Valentine's.</p>
                                        <h3>Is Valentine's big in India?</h3>
                                        <p>Growing rapidly — urban younger demographics. Culturally-sensitive positioning in some regions helps.</p>
                                        <h3>What is CPM inflation during Valentine's?</h3>
                                        <p>30-60% peak 2 weeks in USA / UK / UAE / India urban. Concentrate spend during actual purchase windows.</p>
                                        <h3>Should brands target men or women for Valentine's?</h3>
                                        <p>Men buy more Valentine's gifts than women in most D2C categories. Male-targeted creative typically outperforms female-targeted for gift purchases.</p>
